<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fa" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>BAKHSHIAN GAME</title>

<style>
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #080610;
    color: white;
    overflow-x: hidden;
}

body::before {
    content: "";
    position: fixed;
    inset: -50%;
    z-index: -1;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%,
      #7200ff44, transparent 35%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 70% 70%,
      #b000ff33, transparent 35%);
    animation: glow 8s infinite alternate;
}

@keyframes glow {
    from { transform: translate(-5%, -3%); }
    to { transform: translate(5%, 3%); }
}

header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 22px 7%;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #a855f733;
    background: #080610bb;
}

.logo {
    color: #c084fc;
    font-size: 21px;
    font-weight: 900;
    text-shadow: 0 0 15px #a855f7;
}

nav a {
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-right: 18px;
    font-size: 14px;
}

.hero {
    min-height: 75vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 35px 20px;
}

.badge {
    color: #d8b4fe;
    border: 1px solid #9333ea;
    padding: 9px 18px;
    border-radius: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px #9333ea33;
}

h1 {
    font-size: clamp(36px, 8vw, 76px);
    font-weight: 1000;
    background: linear-gradient(
      90deg, #fff, #c084fc, #7c3aed, #fff
    );
    background-size: 200%;
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
    animation: shine 4s linear infinite;
}

@keyframes shine {
    to { background-position: 200% center; }
}

.hero p {
    color: #c4b5d9;
    margin: 22px 0 30px;
    line-height: 2;
}

.btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 14px 30px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    color: white;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg,#9333ea,#6d28d9);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: bold;
    box-shadow: 0 0 25px #9333ea66;
    transition: .3s;
}

.btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 0 35px #a855f7;
}

section.games {
    padding: 30px 7% 70px;
}

h2 {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    color: #d8b4fe;
}

.grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
}

.card {
    padding: 28px 15px;
    text-align: center;
    border: 1px solid #a855f744;
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: #170d25cc;
    transition: .3s;
}

.card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    border-color: #c084fc;
    box-shadow: 0 0 25px #9333ea33;
}

.icon {
    font-size: 43px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.card p {
    color: #b9a8cb;
    font-size: 13px;
    margin-top: 12px;
    line-height: 1.8;
}

footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 25px;
    color: #9988aa;
    border-top: 1px solid #a855f733;
    font-size: 13px;
}

@media(max-width: 650px) {
    header {
        padding: 18px 5%;
    }

    .logo {
        font-size: 16px;
    }

    nav a {
        margin-right: 8px;
        font-size: 12px;
    }

    .grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .hero {
        min-height: 65vh;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <div class="logo">👑 BAKHSHIAN GAME</div>
    <nav>
        <a href="#home">خانه</a>
        <a href="#games">بازی‌ها</a>
    </nav>
</header>

<main>
    <section class="hero" id="home">
        <div class="badge">⚡ NEXT LEVEL GAMING</div>

        <h1>BAKHSHIAN GAME</h1>

        <p>
            وارد دنیای گیمینگ شو! 🎮<br>
            جایی برای گیمرهای واقعی و حرفه‌ای.
        </p>

        <a href="#games" class="btn">🚀 شروع ماجراجویی</a>
    </section>

    <section class="games" id="games">
        <h2>🎮 دنیای بازی‌ها</h2>

        <div class="grid">
            <article class="card">
                <div class="icon">🔫</div>
                <h3>اکشن</h3>
                <p>دنیایی پر از هیجان و رقابت.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
                <div class="icon">🏎️</div>
                <h3>ماشین‌سواری</h3>
                <p>سرعت، مسابقه و آدرنالین.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
                <div class="icon">🌍</div>
                <h3>ماجراجویی</h3>
                <p>جهان‌های جدید را کشف کن.</p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </section>
</main>

<footer>
    © 2026 BAKHSHIAN GAME | ساخته‌شده برای گیمرها 💜
</footer>

</body>
</html>
